bf-private-server
=================

An unofficial, non-commercial Brave Frontier (client v2.19.6) private-server
revival. Except where noted below, the code in this repository is released
under the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3 or (at your option) any
later version. See LICENSE (repository root) and server/LICENSE.


