Upstream projects
-----------------

The game server in server/ is a fork of a fork:

  decompfrontier/server
    The original "Decompfrontier Server" C++ game-server emulator for Brave
    Frontier v2.19.6, part of the Brave Frontier Offline Mod effort, itself
    inspired by the earlier GimuFrontier C# proof of concept.
    License: AGPL-3.0-or-later.
    Contributors to the upstream history include Arves100, Evan Martine,
    Si Yuan He and Tom2096.
    https://decompfrontier.github.io/

  Seltraeh/server
    Fork of decompfrontier/server that this repository's server/ tree is
    based on, maintained by Seltraeh.
    License: AGPL-3.0-or-later.
    https://github.com/Seltraeh/server

  Seltraeh/packet-generator
    Rust build-time packet/schema code generator by Seltraeh and the
    upstream packet-generator authors. Vendored in this repository as
    server/packet-generator: a fork with project-specific schema changes.
    License: Mozilla Public License 2.0, which applies to the files in that
    directory (see server/packet-generator/LICENSE).
    https://github.com/Seltraeh/packet-generator

All changes made in this repository on top of those projects are released
under the same AGPL-3.0-or-later terms, except changes to files in
server/packet-generator, which remain under MPL-2.0.


Third-party libraries
---------------------

The following libraries are not vendored in this repository. They are fetched
at build or install time by their package managers (vcpkg for the server, pip
for the Python tools, npm for the Workers' development tooling) and remain under
their own licenses:

  Server (server/vcpkg.json)
    Drogon (with Trantor) ........ MIT License
    Crypto++ ..................... Boost Software License 1.0
    SQLite ....................... Public domain
    glaze ........................ MIT License

  Server release package
    Howard Hinnant's date library  MIT License; its notice is kept in
                                   server/packaging/date-LICENSE.txt and is
                                   installed into the portable release ZIP
                                   together with the vcpkg dependency notices
                                   (server/packaging/Install.cmake).

  Python tools (installed by the user)
    PyCryptodome ................. BSD 2-Clause / public domain (see project)

  Cloudflare Workers tooling (cdn-worker/package.json, devDependencies only)
    wrangler, miniflare, pngjs, jpeg-js: see each package's license.


Community data sources
----------------------

Some tools read publicly available community data at run time. That data is
not included in this repository and is subject to its own terms:

  - BluuArc's Brave Frontier archive (game content served by the server).

Thanks to everyone who preserved the game's data and documented its behaviour.
